# Bank source documents stay out of distributed history.
# The extracted regulatory text is versioned in .brain/01_Business_Requirement/*.md.
# If the repository is ever hosted off-machine, this prevents a scanned bank letter
# travelling with it. Re-include deliberately with: git add -f <file>
.brain/01_Business_Requirement/*.pdf

